**http://127.0.0.1:14242/dashboard/**

It was opened in the default browser. The tunnel is a background SSH process,
not a new system service. To close this session's tunnel:

```sh
ssh -S /tmp/mrmr-dashboard-tunnel.EeQZe3/control -O exit marvin
